	(text "INPUT — 19 V adapter in, protection, 19 V out to the Jetson carrier\nGolden reference: datasheets/lm74700-q1.pdf, datasheets/reference/ti-slvae57b-basics-of-ideal-diodes.pdf\nParts (LCSC): LM74700QDBVRQ1 C2941042 + N-FET, SMBJ24A C19077578, XT30PW-M C431092, fuse\nProduces: +19V_IN (after fuse, ideal diode, TVS, bulk), +19V_JETSON (fused pass-through to J2)\nNet class: PWR_19V is assigned by project pattern to +19V_IN and +19V_JETSON.\nOpen items: D6 (Jetson carrier input range/polarity, J2 connector type)\nBring-up: test point + power-good LED on +19V_IN."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
